 "notes": [
  "Kit batch kit-batch-8504-20261121 (2026-11-21), group 1 (Eastern docklands). Twin of Veemkade 1106-1210 (veemkade-1106-068169): the same system and colours, re-read on this pand's own crops, which agree bay for bay.",
  "Groups: 0 the west 38 m of the street wall (w02-196 2025-06-16): seven bays of a grey fibre-cement panel storey with one wide three-light window per bay between two recessed balcony storeys with dark mesh balustrades and dark soffits, the grey fins at the bay joints left as wall between per-bay loggias; ground a tall glazed storey with timber frames under the cantilevered slab; 1 the east 22 m (w03-196 2024-10-16), four bays, aligned with 0; 2 the 68 m quay wall (w01-16 2025-06-16, 45 % foliage): ribbed grey metal bands with ribbon windows on six upper storeys over the same glazed timber ground.",
  "mainSurface: the street panels are cut into many 3DBAG surfaces (some only to 12-13 m); the widest full-height surface carries the bay grid.",
  "otherWalls: the stepped set-back walls behind the street front (15-23 m, sawtooth timber roof pavilions) and the short east and west ends have no straight crop; they stay in the shader window grid."
 ]
